# Rajida Holdings – Supabase REST API tests
# Sign in, see who you are, sign out.
@url = {{$dotenv SUPABASE_URL}}
@key = {{$dotenv SUPABASE_ANON_KEY}}
@token = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 0) Sign in first (click "Send Request" here) – the other requests use this token
# @name login
POST {{url}}/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password
apikey: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{$dotenv TEST_EMAIL}}", "password": "{{$dotenv TEST_PASSWORD}}" }

### 1) Who am I (Supabase Auth user)
GET {{url}}/auth/v1/user
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2) My staff profile and role
GET {{url}}/rest/v1/user?select=user_id,full_name,email,user_type,is_active,is_locked,role(role_name)&email=eq.{{$dotenv TEST_EMAIL}}
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3) Without a token the data is protected (Row Level Security) – returns an empty list []
GET {{url}}/rest/v1/product?select=product_id,name
apikey: {{key}}

### 4) Sign out
POST {{url}}/auth/v1/logout
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
